  "architecture_decision": "simple_crm.data_quality owns source-document metadata, immutable workbook row evidence, import state, preview counters, source-to-canonical links, and import audit events. The parser is bounded and lossless, never mutates canonical CRM records during upload/preview, and is idempotent by checksum plus parser/application version. Approval and application are distinct audited steward actions; ambiguous rows remain staged for CRM-011 rather than being auto-corrected.",
